{:adr/id "2607153900"
 :adr/title "cloud-itonami-isic-855 — Educational Support Activities Actor"
 :adr/status :accepted
 :adr/date "2026-07-15"
 :adr/deciders ["Jun Kawasaki"]
 :adr/scope ["orgs/cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-isic-855"
            "orgs/kotoba-lang/industry"]
 :adr/context
 "Educational support activities (ISIC 855) encompasses testing/assessment
  administration, educational consulting, and student-exchange services.
  This actor focuses on standardized test administration logistics:
  session scheduling, proctor assignment proposals, consumables coordination,
  attendance logging, and integrity-concern flagging. Excludes test content,
  grading, eligibility, academic policy, safety-authority decisions.
  Implemented as Wave 4 actor following patterns in ADR-2607152900 (ISIC 851),
  ADR-2607153700 (ISIC 852), ADR-2607153800 (ISIC 853/854)."
 :adr/decisions
